{"cited_chunk_ids_snapshot":["cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p111:0107","cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p042:0023","cb_calamos_2003_convertible_arbitrage:p143:0159","cb_despiegeleer_schoutens_vanhulle_2014_hybrid_securities:p068:0078","cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013"],"cited_chunk_set_delta":{"added":["cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p111:0107","cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p042:0023","cb_calamos_2003_convertible_arbitrage:p143:0159","cb_despiegeleer_schoutens_vanhulle_2014_hybrid_securities:p068:0078","cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013"],"removed":[]},"event_checksum":"17d04e09256375dd56f7d7242d9183e90a2569e4a31241246bea340909cf22d6","frontmatter_field_changes":["citations","id","reading_id","schema_version","summary","tags","title"],"frontmatter_snapshot":{"card_edges":[],"citations":[{"chunk_hash":"d52dc30103c21a11c546426ea592940c24958bbd454ce19e1ec7a5ea8061d891","chunk_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed:p111:0107","edge_type":"defines","page_range":[111,112],"quote":"投资者只要坚守纪律，甚 至无须太多关心股市和股票本身，耐心等待强制赎回的到来就行了， 这特别适合信息和技术都处于劣势的小散户们。","source_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2014_magic_book_2ed"},{"chunk_hash":"d1759bf1d5a2e227d8042e883e2f7c5b23578ceafb56bde706808339f8696de5","chunk_id":"cb_calamos_2003_convertible_arbitrage:p143:0159","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[143,144],"quote":"If parity does fall below the call price, the company will be forced to pay cash instead of stock to the holders.","source_id":"cb_calamos_2003_convertible_arbitrage"},{"chunk_hash":"267a3eae776fe08cacefcf8b36127e54f1618d7df650bcd482a4144396d57c75","chunk_id":"cb_despiegeleer_schoutens_vanhulle_2014_hybrid_securities:p068:0078","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[68,69],"quote":"The real expiry date of the convertible was 4 years later but the issuer decided to redeem its convertible prematurely.","source_id":"cb_despiegeleer_schoutens_vanhulle_2014_hybrid_securities"},{"chunk_hash":"12ba11a3b16c4217a488a92d5add3adf4a97e0cc2f4b287f67412109a1e818a9","chunk_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed:p042:0023","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[42,43],"quote":"我们的看法是，强赎与否，利益使然。 ‚缺钱的时候拿现釐，不缺钱的时候拿股权‛，或者捡一种表述， 即‚股权值钱的时候留股权，股权不值钱的时候选现釐‛。","source_id":"cb_an_daoquan_2023_three_line_duplex_3ed"},{"chunk_hash":"0c90836e80f05cbf3fb35bd9baaf8875ff0e4989b6e6a20ba7e0a2b17c9e98ca","chunk_id":"cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed:p016:0013","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[16,17],"quote":"当公司普通股股票在任意连续三十个交易日中有十五个交易日的收盘价低于当 期转股价格的80%时，公司董事会有权提出转股价格向下修正方案并提交公司股东 大会审议表决。","source_id":"cb_gongshou_practical_handbook_1ed"}],"id":"cb-china-call-redemption-rules","reading_id":"08_convertible_bonds","schema_version":"cacg.v0","summary":"China onshore convertibles almost universally include a 强赎 (strong-call) provision: issuer may force redemption at face once the share price spends 15 of 30 consecutive days at ≥ 130% of K_c; once triggered, the announcement gives holders ~1 month to convert before remaining bonds redeem at face — the structural mechanism that mid-life converts the average China-onshore CB into equity.","tags":["convertible-bonds","china-call"],"title":"China Convertible-Bond Call-Redemption Rules"},"is_retracted":false,"new_card_hash":"f49a65849b97b609d9a7a236ec4500ea0a56c2caf3a2cc1ce32767e18117b6e5","prev_card_hash":null,"prev_checksum":null,"schema_version":"cacg.v0","seq":0,"timestamp":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
